1029
01:00:16,113 --> 01:00:18,982
Got it, so knock it off!
My ears are bleeding.

1030
01:00:19,749 --> 01:00:22,018
Do you go to a nagging academy
or something?

1031
01:00:22,085 --> 01:00:23,019
Seriously.

1032
01:00:23,687 --> 01:00:25,856
Hey, where did Hyeok go?

1033
01:00:25,922 --> 01:00:27,324
Hey, we've got trouble!

1034
01:00:27,390 --> 01:00:29,793
What's that noise?

1035
01:00:31,294 --> 01:00:33,663
-Is it a fight?
-A fight?

1036
01:00:33,730 --> 01:00:35,432
A fight?

1037
01:00:35,499 --> 01:00:37,434
In that case,

1038
01:00:37,501 --> 01:00:38,969
we gotta go watch!

1039
01:00:40,270 --> 01:00:42,239
Let's go, let's go!

1040
01:00:42,305 --> 01:00:44,674
Move, move, move!

1041
01:00:45,775 --> 01:00:47,944
Seniors coming through!

1042
01:00:48,011 --> 01:00:49,880
Hey, out of the way!

1043
01:00:51,581 --> 01:00:53,016
Hyeok.

1044
01:00:55,285 --> 01:00:56,653
Hyeok.

1045
01:00:58,155 --> 01:00:59,623
The CEO?

1046
01:01:03,160 --> 01:01:04,861
You bastard.

1047
01:01:08,231 --> 01:01:10,300
Do something!

1048
01:01:10,367 --> 01:01:12,636
-Hey, stop!
-Don't!

1049
01:01:12,702 --> 01:01:14,404
Stop it, stop!

1050
01:01:18,508 --> 01:01:20,877
What on earth was the reason?

1051
01:01:22,045 --> 01:01:25,715
I won't get mad, so just tell me.

1052
01:01:25,782 --> 01:01:30,187
It's all in the past.
Why can't you tell me? Why?

1053
01:01:30,253 --> 01:01:31,354
Drop it, Min-ki.

1054
01:01:31,421 --> 01:01:34,558
Why bring up the past
and ruin the mood?

1055
01:01:34,624 --> 01:01:38,261
Knowing won't change anything.

1056
01:01:46,136 --> 01:01:47,437
Min-ki.

1057
01:01:47,504 --> 01:01:49,639
The four of us are finally together.

1058
01:01:50,307 --> 01:01:51,575
Why don't we jam?

1059
01:01:53,043 --> 01:01:54,844
Jam? Out here?

1060
01:01:54,911 --> 01:01:57,948
Come on, let's just play
and get back in sync.

1061
01:01:58,014 --> 01:01:59,783
We still need to release our album.

1062
01:02:00,383 --> 01:02:01,585
Right?

1063
01:02:01,651 --> 01:02:04,287
Come on, guys. Let's do it!

1064
01:02:25,242 --> 01:02:29,179
When love comes, it's without warning

1065
01:02:29,246 --> 01:02:33,483
When love comes, it steps so softly

1066
01:02:33,550 --> 01:02:38,154
When love comes, it's like a shower

1067
01:02:38,221 --> 01:02:42,292
Just smiling in pure happiness

1068
01:02:43,426 --> 01:02:45,762
Will you hear my heart?

1069
01:02:45,829 --> 01:02:50,033
Should I send it on the wind?

1070
01:02:51,568 --> 01:02:53,103
Send my heart again?

1071
01:02:53,169 --> 01:02:56,873
For the first time in a while,
I felt truly alive.

1072
01:02:56,940 --> 01:02:59,743
I felt like everything
would work out from now on.

1073
01:03:04,381 --> 01:03:07,484
However, a totally unexpected

1074
01:03:07,550 --> 01:03:09,986
and massive disaster struck.

1075
01:03:17,360 --> 01:03:19,496
I'm sorry. Please don't hit me.

1076
01:03:19,562 --> 01:03:22,098
Mother, I'm sorry. Don't hit me.

1077
01:03:23,733 --> 01:03:25,702
I'm so sorry…

1078
01:03:36,813 --> 01:03:38,181
It's hot.

1079
01:03:40,550 --> 01:03:42,352
Hey, turn off the heat.
